@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@
+## Context
+
+The domain returns `Result` and never throws; `createTask`, `renameTask` and `addTag` in `task.ts` currently accept anything.
+
+## Decisions
+
+- Add error code `invalid-input` to `TodoErrorCode`.
+- Add exported validators in `task.ts` (`validateTitle`, `validatePriority`, `validateTag`) returning `Result`. `list.ts` calls them first in `add`, `rename` and `tag`, before the duplicate check and before issuing an id or reading the clock, so rejection has no effect.
+- The title length limit applies to the trimmed title, matching how titles are stored.
+- Tags are not trimmed; a tag with any space is rejected. Priority is checked at runtime since screens may pass untyped strings.
+- Reference lookup errors (`not-found`) keep precedence for rename/tag only if the input is valid; invalid input is reported first.
